  "description": "Seo-Byeol, a girl from an island village, grew up alongside her childhood friend Min-Jae, who was born with innate talent for painting. Through him, she developed an interest and dream for art. Eventually, the two moved to the capital together and enrolled in an art high school. While preparing for art school entrance exams, Seo-Byeol feels inferior to Min-Jae, and the sibling-like bond between them begins to crack.\n\nIt's the summer of their senior year, when they should be focusing intensely. Seo-Byeol faces a crisis: her family's financial troubles force her to give up everything and return to the island...\n\n*“Come to my place, Oh Seo-Byeol.”*\n\nAfter much deliberation, Seo-Byeol accepts Min-Jae's offer, and their secret cohabitation begins!\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
